    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1070">

                <pb facs="0942" n="935" sameAs="frus:frus1937v03/pg935"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.5151 Manchuria/17: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Counselor of Embassy in China</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Lockhart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-11-12T13:00:00+08:00">November 12, 1937—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received November 12—3:18 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>744. Your 361, November 10, 5 p.m.<anchor n="55" xml:id="d1070-f1"/> Following
                    from Mukden.</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“No. 7, November 11, noon. With reference to the Department’s telegram No.
                        333 to the Embassy at Peiping,<anchor n="56" xml:id="d1070-f2"/> I again
                        called on Director of the Foreign Office who assured me that he is taking
                        steps to remedy discriminatory treatment of revised exchange control
                        law.”</p>
                </quote>
                <pb facs="0943" n="936" xml:id="pg936"/>
                <p>Mukden has been instructed to keep Embassy fully informed of all
                    developments.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lockhart</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1070-f1" n="55" xml:id="d1070-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it requested further information (893.5151 Manchuria/15).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1070-f2" n="56" xml:id="d1070-f2-content">
                <p>October 19, 3 p.m., <ref target="#pg930">p. 930</ref>.</p>
